# PayTMunim demo — environment template (safe to commit; contains no secrets).
#
# Do not type a PIN or hash into this file. Run:
#     npm run configure:pin
# It asks for the owner PIN privately and writes only its SHA-256 hash to the
# ignored file .env.local, which both `npm run dev` and `npm run start` read.
#
# DEMO_PIN_HASH=<64 hex characters: SHA-256 of the owner PIN>
#
# Optional, for `npm run start` only:
# HOST=127.0.0.1   # use 0.0.0.0 to reach the built app from another device on your network
# PORT=8787
